                    Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d410-f5" n="6" xml:id="d410-f5-content">
                <p>Note No. 208, <ref target="frus1948v04#pg_1020">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1948, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iv</hi>, p. 1020</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d410-f6" n="7" xml:id="d410-f6-content">
                <p>Clifford C. Matlock was Special Assistant to the Director of the Office of
                    European Affairs.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
